<title>USA: Pall says top court denies patent challenge.</title>
<headline>Pall says top court denies patent challenge.</headline>
<dateline>EAST HILLS, N.Y. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pall Corp said on Friday that the U.S. Supreme Court denied Micron Separations Inc's petition to review a U.S. Appeals Court decision that upheld a Pall Corp patent.</p>
<p>This decision confirmed that Pall's U.S. Patent No. 4,340,479 is valid and was infringed by Micron Separation's nylon membrane.</p>
<p>A lower court entered more than $16 million in judgments against Micron Separation, Pall said.</p>
</text>
